    <section-starting-page>
        <title>Kreate</title>
        <description>
            One declarative DSL for Kotlin JVM and Multiplatform builds — platform setup,
            native interop, security scanning, documentation, testing and publishing,
            without the Gradle boilerplate.
        </description>

